{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"90e9e14b-46b8-4aac-9fca-972709e25d56","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the Hedera JavaScript SDK integration and added an offline transfer script.\n\n- Updated **package.json** to include `@hashgraph/sdk` (`^2.81.0`) and installed dependencies.  \n- Created **src/transfer.ts** that:\n  - Loads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START` from `.env`.\n  - Builds a custom `TransactionId` with the given `VALID_START`.\n  - Constructs a `TransferTransaction` for 1 HBAR from the operator to the recipient, with memo `invoice 42` and node `0.0.3`.\n  - Signs the transaction with the operator’s ED25519 private key.\n  - Prints the signed transaction bytes as a hex string (offline only).\n- Verified the project compiles with `npx tsc --noEmit` (no errors).  \n- Added a short description of usage.\n\nFor detailed steps and verification, see the generated **ANSWER.md** artifact:\n\n[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/90e9e14b-46b8-4aac-9fca-972709e25d56/ANSWER.md)\n","duration_seconds":78.786921,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":18717,"output_tokens":7587,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":213184,"total_tokens":26304}}}
